      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SESH (9) won well two back before a disappointing effort last time out in a stronger race. Back to a Class 5 now and Turner remains in the saddle from a better draw. Form around him has been good and he can play a leading role. YAMASHITA'S GOLD (7) comes to WA now and joins the Dylan Bairstow stable. He tackled some stronger races last campaign, ending in a good race at Flemington. Galati sticks from the latest trial and he can play a leading role. DESERT DANCING (4) will find this easier today after racing in Saturday company recently. Hasn't won for a while, but she's racing in good order and the wide draw is no issue. Watch for her flying late in the race. ART SESSION (2) can bounce back to form stepping up to 1100m again. GOLD VANCOUVER (8) pulled up with an issue last start but is better than that. Can improve now.",
